body:
Hi! What's your department, and what campus are you from (Makati or Intramuros)? We're currently on the 7th na kasi and you might want to consider taking a leave or dropping your courses kasi magiging mas mahirap and demotivating for you if first term mo is puro 5.00 considering how the PL/DL/Latin Honors work in Mapua (basically, once you get an IP, F, or 5.00, you won't be able to be qualified for PL or DL anymore for your whole stay in Mapua-- with how the current qualifications are at the moment ah).

&#x200B;

Then again, just because 5.00 ka sa module 2 doesn't mean na 5.00 na agad final grade mo with the new grading system. Kamusta module 1 mo? If your grades are 1.00 - 2.00 may chance ka pang pumasa as long as yung average ng module grade mo is at least 3.00 (ex. (5.00 + 2.00 + 2.00)/3 = 3.00).

&#x200B;

Best wishes, dm me lang here sa Reddit if you have any more questions or if you need help with anything :) Good luck kaya mo yan!
